  "details": "I would love to have a component added to the SDK that dictates the speed at which a joint is allowed to move. \n\nThis would open up a lot of options for replicating mechanical parts like robotics and other industrial-styled parts.\n\nThis would especially be helpful to work in combination with rotation constraints and aim constraints.\n\nEdit: another parameter that would be really nice to have along these would be delay of movement",
